ex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class=3D"markdown prose dark:pr=
ose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start=
=3D"0" data-end=3D"217">For a small rental vehicle business in Australia, i=
nsurers mainly want to see that you have a professional rental or lease agr=
eement that clearly transfers responsibilities to the renter and outlines t=
he rules of use.</p>
<p data-start=3D"219" data-end=3D"414">You can absolutely draft the agreeme=
nt yourself initially. Many small operators do this when starting out. Howe=
ver, once the business grows, it is strongly recommended to have a lawyer r=
eview it.</p>
<p data-start=3D"416" data-end=3D"450">What insurers usually want to see:</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"451" data-end=3D"827">
<li data-section-id=3D"oxp4dz" data-start=3D"451" data-end=3D"484">
<p data-start=3D"453" data-end=3D"484">Driver eligibility requirements</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1679ukv" data-start=3D"485" data-end=3D"507">
<p data-start=3D"487" data-end=3D"507">Licence requirements</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1sq9ep8" data-start=3D"508" data-end=3D"526">
<p data-start=3D"510" data-end=3D"526">Age restrictions</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"xecwje" data-start=3D"527" data-end=3D"553">
<p data-start=3D"529" data-end=3D"553">Damage liability clauses</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"j2r5vu" data-start=3D"554" data-end=3D"585">
<p data-start=3D"556" data-end=3D"585">Excess/payment responsibility</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"rq7ca2" data-start=3D"586" data-end=3D"603">
<p data-start=3D"588" data-end=3D"603">Prohibited uses</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1adfsw2" data-start=3D"604" data-end=3D"623">
<p data-start=3D"606" data-end=3D"623">Return conditions</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"bd6ug0" data-start=3D"624" data-end=3D"645">
<p data-start=3D"626" data-end=3D"645">Late return clauses</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"kcxzpn" data-start=3D"646" data-end=3D"677">
<p data-start=3D"648" data-end=3D"677">Accident reporting procedures</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1estutw" data-start=3D"678" data-end=3D"703">
<p data-start=3D"680" data-end=3D"703">Maintenance obligations</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"vvxqca" data-start=3D"704" data-end=3D"726">
<p data-start=3D"706" data-end=3D"726">Smoking/pet policies</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"10fubqw" data-start=3D"727" data-end=3D"742">
<p data-start=3D"729" data-end=3D"742">Cleaning fees</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1tg4u5b" data-start=3D"743" data-end=3D"764">
<p data-start=3D"745" data-end=3D"764">Cancellation policy</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1goqq6v" data-start=3D"765" data-end=3D"784">
<p data-start=3D"767" data-end=3D"784">Indemnity clauses</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1diuduq" data-start=3D"785" data-end=3D"827">
<p data-start=3D"787" data-end=3D"827">Acknowledgement of insurance limitat=
ions</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"829" data-end=3D"936">For your type of business (private v=
ehicle rentals in Tasmania), insurers are usually more concerned about:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"937" data-end=3D"1044">
<li data-section-id=3D"1utv861" data-start=3D"937" data-end=3D"954">
<p data-start=3D"940" data-end=3D"954">Who is driving</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"wp49v6" data-start=3D"955" data-end=3D"987">
<p data-start=3D"958" data-end=3D"987">How the vehicle is being used</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1bu696k" data-start=3D"988" data-end=3D"1044">
<p data-start=3D"991" data-end=3D"1044">Whether your contract protects the =
insurer=E2=80=99s position</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"1046" data-end=3D"1101">A basic homemade agreement can wor=
k initially if it is:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1102" data-end=3D"1193">
<li data-section-id=3D"1vwxb43" data-start=3D"1102" data-end=3D"1116">
<p data-start=3D"1104" data-end=3D"1116">professional</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"16c3lf5" data-start=3D"1117" data-end=3D"1124">
<p data-start=3D"1119" data-end=3D"1124">clear</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1rhh8hk" data-start=3D"1125" data-end=3D"1135">
<p data-start=3D"1127" data-end=3D"1135">detailed</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"eq54bp" data-start=3D"1136" data-end=3D"1153">
<p data-start=3D"1138" data-end=3D"1153">signed properly</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"rdc6gx" data-start=3D"1154" data-end=3D"1193">
<p data-start=3D"1156" data-end=3D"1193">consistent with your insurance pol=
icy</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1195" data-end=3D"1240">But there are risks if you write i=
t yourself:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1241" data-end=3D"1446">
<li data-section-id=3D"25w8sj" data-start=3D"1241" data-end=3D"1271">
<p data-start=3D"1243" data-end=3D"1271">clauses may be unenforceable</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"14pgdbd" data-start=3D"1272" data-end=3D"1323">
<p data-start=3D"1274" data-end=3D"1323">wording may conflict with Australi=
an Consumer Law</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"tg8att" data-start=3D"1324" data-end=3D"1379">
<p data-start=3D"1326" data-end=3D"1379">insurance exclusions may not align=
 with your contract</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1tjibuz" data-start=3D"1380" data-end=3D"1411">
<p data-start=3D"1382" data-end=3D"1411">liability wording may be weak</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1ulefjt" data-start=3D"1412" data-end=3D"1446">
<p data-start=3D"1414" data-end=3D"1446">excess recovery clauses may fail</=
p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1448" data-end=3D"1485">For example:<br>
You cannot simply write:</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"1486" data-end=3D"1545">
<p data-start=3D"1488" data-end=3D"1545">=E2=80=9CRenter is liable for all =
damage under all circumstances=E2=80=9D</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"1547" data-end=3D"1611">and assume it is automatically enf=
orceable under Australian law.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1613" data-end=3D"1689">For rental cars specifically, insu=
rers often prefer agreements that include:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1690" data-end=3D"1986">
<li data-section-id=3D"5ntpbf" data-start=3D"1690" data-end=3D"1718">
<p data-start=3D"1692" data-end=3D"1718">Full renter identification</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"hejlus" data-start=3D"1719" data-end=3D"1748">
<p data-start=3D"1721" data-end=3D"1748">Driver licence verification</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"18n5lbv" data-start=3D"1749" data-end=3D"1778">
<p data-start=3D"1751" data-end=3D"1778">Bond/security deposit terms</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1cd6dyx" data-start=3D"1779" data-end=3D"1818">
<p data-start=3D"1781" data-end=3D"1818">Accident reporting within a timefr=
ame</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1frz5w7" data-start=3D"1819" data-end=3D"1844">
<p data-start=3D"1821" data-end=3D"1844">No-drink-driving clause</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"10maihb" data-start=3D"1845" data-end=3D"1876">
<p data-start=3D"1847" data-end=3D"1876">No unauthorised driver clause</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1cyfzno" data-start=3D"1877" data-end=3D"1902">
<p data-start=3D"1879" data-end=3D"1902">Geographic restrictions</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1roupdc" data-start=3D"1903" data-end=3D"1932">
<p data-start=3D"1905" data-end=3D"1932">Commercial use restrictions</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1e1v6n7" data-start=3D"1933" data-end=3D"1954">
<p data-start=3D"1935" data-end=3D"1954">Towing restrictions</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"10v6dry" data-start=3D"1955" data-end=3D"1986">
<p data-start=3D"1957" data-end=3D"1986">Mechanical negligence clauses</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1988" data-end=3D"2070">For your fleet idea (Corolla, Outl=
ander, Forester, etc.), you should also include:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2071" data-end=3D"2201">
<li data-section-id=3D"fw1xtt" data-start=3D"2071" data-end=3D"2110">
<p data-start=3D"2073" data-end=3D"2110">Condition report with diagrams/pho=
tos</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"13tpinn" data-start=3D"2111" data-end=3D"2140">
<p data-start=3D"2113" data-end=3D"2140">Pre-existing damage section</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"6q4mnm" data-start=3D"2141" data-end=3D"2154">
<p data-start=3D"2143" data-end=3D"2154">Fuel policy</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"jjzzr8" data-start=3D"2155" data-end=3D"2173">
<p data-start=3D"2157" data-end=3D"2173">Kilometre limits</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"ruerow" data-start=3D"2174" data-end=3D"2201">
<p data-start=3D"2176" data-end=3D"2201">Roadside assistance rules</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2203" data-end=3D"2249">Most small operators start like th=
is:<br>
Stage 1:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2250" data-end=3D"2314">
<li data-section-id=3D"125xm8o" data-start=3D"2250" data-end=3D"2274">
<p data-start=3D"2252" data-end=3D"2274">Self-written agreement</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1c54f7t" data-start=3D"2275" data-end=3D"2314">
<p data-start=3D"2277" data-end=3D"2314">Reviewed by insurer/broker informa=
lly</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2316" data-end=3D"2324">Stage 2:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2325" data-end=3D"2417">
<li data-section-id=3D"h2si53" data-start=3D"2325" data-end=3D"2352">
<p data-start=3D"2327" data-end=3D"2352">Lawyer-polished agreement</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"vr5iv5" data-start=3D"2353" data-end=3D"2385">
<p data-start=3D"2355" data-end=3D"2385">Customised to insurance policy</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"w7o1z0" data-start=3D"2386" data-end=3D"2417">
<p data-start=3D"2388" data-end=3D"2417">Commercial hire clauses added</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2419" data-end=3D"2427">Stage 3:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2428" data-end=3D"2579">
<li data-section-id=3D"rrx2bn" data-start=3D"2428" data-end=3D"2462">
<p data-start=3D"2430" data-end=3D"2462">Full commercial fleet legal pack</=
p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"xmq61a" data-start=3D"2463" data-end=3D"2479">
<p data-start=3D"2465" data-end=3D"2479">Privacy policy</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1eaedpc" data-start=3D"2480" data-end=3D"2503">
<p data-start=3D"2482" data-end=3D"2503">Credit card authority</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1fm98on" data-start=3D"2504" data-end=3D"2529">
<p data-start=3D"2506" data-end=3D"2529">Damage claim procedures</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"s04rbt" data-start=3D"2530" data-end=3D"2555">
<p data-start=3D"2532" data-end=3D"2555">GPS/privacy disclosures</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1fcx80y" data-start=3D"2556" data-end=3D"2579">
<p data-start=3D"2558" data-end=3D"2579">Debt recovery clauses</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2581" data-end=3D"2614">A good approach for you would be:<=
/p>
<ol data-start=3D"2615" data-end=3D"2816">
<li data-section-id=3D"zf202s" data-start=3D"2615" data-end=3D"2648">
<p data-start=3D"2618" data-end=3D"2648">Create a strong draft yourself</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1qjvrjp" data-start=3D"2649" data-end=3D"2703">
<p data-start=3D"2652" data-end=3D"2663">Send it to:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2667" data-end=3D"2703">
<li data-section-id=3D"1hfar99" data-start=3D"2667" data-end=3D"2681">
<p data-start=3D"2669" data-end=3D"2681">your insurer</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"t98kgh" data-start=3D"2685" data-end=3D"2703">
<p data-start=3D"2687" data-end=3D"2703">insurance broker</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
