<p data-start=3D"1652" data-end=3D"1744">Because if your insurance wording =
differs from your agreement, it can create problems later.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1746" data-end=3D"1794">A cleaner and more professional cl=
ause would be:</p>
<p data-start=3D"1796" data-end=3D"1972">=E2=80=9CVehicles must be operated=
 responsibly and in accordance with Australian road laws. Reckless driving,=
 unlawful use, racing, or operation by unauthorised drivers is prohibited.=
=E2=80=9D</p>
<p data-start=3D"1974" data-end=3D"2015">instead of very aggressive legal w=
ording.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2017" data-end=3D"2123">Also:<br>
You should avoid making promises about insurance coverage that your policy =
may not actually provide.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2125" data-end=3D"2149">For example, instead of:</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"2150" data-end=3D"2175">
<p data-start=3D"2152" data-end=3D"2175">=E2=80=9CDamage Cover applies=E2=
=80=A6=E2=80=9D</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"2177" data-end=3D"2195">better wording is:</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"2196" data-end=3D"2291">
<p data-start=3D"2198" data-end=3D"2291">=E2=80=9CVehicle use remains subje=
ct to the terms and conditions of the applicable insurance policy.=E2=80=9D=
</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"2293" data-end=3D"2323">That protects you more safely.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2325" data-end=3D"2380">The best version for a real startu=
p operation would be:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2381" data-end=3D"2497">
